cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI Psychosis Watch"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and record your access date — the data changes weekly."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "AI Psychosis Watch"
    website: "https://aipsychosis.watch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/notOccupanther/ai-psychosis-tracker"
url: "https://aipsychosis.watch"
abstract: >-
  A weekly-updated record of reported psychological harm associated with
  conversational AI systems — delusional reinforcement, distorted reality
  testing, identity confusion, paranoia and dependent attachment — alongside the
  clinical and research literature examining those phenomena. Entries document
  reports rather than verified diagnoses, and counts reflect coverage rather
  than incidence.
keywords:
  - AI psychosis
  - chatbot harm
  - mental health
  - human-AI interaction
  - parasocial attachment
  - AI safety
license: CC-BY-4.0
